Third-party notices
===================

Parts of this integration are adapted from the MIT-licensed projects below.
Their copyright and permission notices are reproduced here as that license
requires.

- Renpho Health cloud client: ha-renpho-health and renpho-api
  https://github.com/DiscountDarcy/ha-renpho-health
  https://pypi.org/project/renpho-api/
- 0x55aa Bluetooth protocol and body-composition formulas:
  renpho_fitness_scale_ble and renpho-escs20m
  https://github.com/ronnnnnnnnnnnnn/renpho_fitness_scale_ble
  https://pypi.org/project/renpho-escs20m/

The MorphoScan (R-MSC04 / R-MSC06) protocol is our own implementation of the
wire facts documented in KristianP26/ble-scale-sync issues #117 and #434. That
project is GPL-3.0 and none of its code is included.

